="external text" data-mw-original-href="//zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%A5%91%E7%BA%A6&amp;action=edit" href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%A5%91%E7%BA%A6&amp;action=edit">改善本條目</a></b>或在<b><a href="/wiki/Talk:%E5%A5%91%E7%BA%A6" title="Talk:契約">討論頁</a></b>針對議題發表看法。
<div class="mw-collapsible-content">
<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r95173163" /><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r95173184" /><table class="box-Expand plainlinks metadata ambox ambox-style" role="presentation"><tbody><tr><td class="mbox-image"><div style="width:52px"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/wiki/File:Antistub.svg" class="mw-file-description"><img src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2a/Antistub.svg/60px-Antistub.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44" class="mw-file-element" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2a/Antistub.svg/120px-Antistub.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="200" data-file-height="200" /></a></span></div></td><td class="mbox-text"><div class="mbox-text-span">此條目<b>需要擴充。</b><span class="hide-when-compact"></span> <small class="date-container"><i>(<span class="date">2011年6月29日</span>)</i></small><span class="hide-when-compact"><br /><small>請協助<a class="external text" data-mw-original-href="//zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%A5%91%E7%BA%A6&amp;action=edit" href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%A5%91%E7%BA%A6&amp;action=edit">改善這篇條目</a>，更進一步的訊息可能會在<a href="/wiki/Talk:%E5%A5%91%E7%BA%A6" title="Talk:契約">討論頁</a>或<a href="/wiki/Wikipedia:%E6%89%A9%E5%85%85%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82" title="Wikipedia:擴充請求">擴充請求</a>中找到。請在擴充條目後將此模板移除。</small></span><span class="hide-when-compact"></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table>
<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r95173163" /><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r95173184" /><table class="box-Expert&#95;needed plainlinks metadata ambox ambox-content" role="presentation"><tbody><tr><td class="mbox-image"><div style="width:52px"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img alt="" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b4/Ambox_important.svg/40px-Ambox_important.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="40" height="40" class="mw-file-element" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b4/Ambox_important.svg/120px-Ambox_important.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="40" data-file-height="40" /></span></span></div></td><td class="mbox-text"><div class="mbox-text-span">此條目需要<b>精通或熟悉<a href="/wiki/%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B" title="法律">法律</a>的編者</b>參與及協助編輯。<span class="hide-when-compact"></span> <small class="date-container"><i>(<span class="date">2019年12月2日</span>)</i></small><span class="hide-when-compact"><br /><small>請<a href="/wiki/Wikipedia:%E5%B0%88%E5%AE%B6%E9%82%80%E8%AB%8B%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E5%B0%8F%E7%B5%84" title="Wikipedia:專家邀請工作小組">邀請</a>適合的人士<a class="external text" data-mw-original-href="//zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%A5%91%E7%BA%A6&amp;action=edit" href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%A5%91%E7%BA%A6&amp;action=edit">改善本條目</a>。更多的細節與詳情請參見<a href="/wiki/Talk:%E5%A5%91%E7%BA%A6" title="Talk:契約">討論頁</a>。<br />另見其他<a href="/wiki/Category:%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%B0%88%E5%AE%B6%E9%97%9C%E6%B3%A8%E7%9A%84%E9%A0%81%E9%9D%A2" title="Category:需要法律專家關注的頁面">需要法律專家關注的頁面</a>。</small></span><span class="hide-when-compact"></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table>
</div></div><span class="hide-when-compact"></span><span class="hide-when-compact"></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table>
<figure class="mw-halign-right" typeof="mw:File/Thumb"><a href="/wiki/File:Rent_Certificate_of_Wang_Xiangchu_in_the_30th_Year_of_the_Daoguang_Reign_2014-04.JPG" class="mw-file-description"><img src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ca/Rent_Certificate_of_Wang_Xiangchu_in_the_30th_Year_of_the_Daoguang_Reign_2014-04.JPG/330px-Rent_Certificate_of_Wang_Xiangchu_in_the_30th_Year_of_the_Daoguang_Reign_2014-04.JPG?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="260" height="195" class="mw-file-element" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ca/Rent_Certificate_of_Wang_Xiangchu_in_the_30th_Year_of_the_Daoguang_Reign_2014-04.JPG/960px-Rent_Certificate_of_Wang_Xiangchu_in_the_30th_Year_of_the_Daoguang_Reign_2014-04.JPG?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="4320" data-file-height="3240" /></a><figcaption><a href="/wiki/%E9%81%93%E5%85%89" title="道光">道光</a>三十年王翔初租屋契約，<a href="/wiki/%E6%B5%99%E6%B1%9F%E7%9C%81%E5%8D%9A%E7%89%A9%E9%A6%86" title="浙江省博物館">浙江省博物館</a>武林館區藏</figcaption></figure>
